{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "TKCreazy Seedance v1 视频生成 API（最终实测版）",
    "version": "2026-08-03-final",
    "description": "这是唯一对外使用的 TKCreazy Seedance v1 视频生成文档，可直接导入 Apifox。所有请求只访问 https://tkcreazy.top/v1，不需要也不得接触任何内部模型平台地址。\n\n最简单的纯文本流程：直接调用 POST /videos/generations，保存返回的 job_id，轮询 GET /videos/jobs/{job_id}，状态变为 completed 后调用 GET /videos/jobs/{job_id}/content 下载 MP4。\n\n使用参考素材的标准流程：\n1. 调用 POST /videos/uploads。图片使用 form-data 字段 image，音频使用 audio，视频使用 video；每次只上传一个字段。\n2. 保存响应中的完整 media_url。upload_id 只用于 GET /videos/uploads/{upload_id} 读取原文件，生成视频时不要使用 upload_id。\n3. 调用 POST /videos/generations，在请求示例中选择单图、首尾帧、多图、视频参考或图片+音频，并把 {{image_media_url}}、{{audio_media_url}}、{{video_media_url}} 替换为上传响应中的实际完整值。\n4. 保存 job_id，每 3 至 5 秒查询一次任务。queued/running 表示继续等待，completed 表示可以下载，failed 表示读取 error。\n5. 调用 GET /videos/jobs/{job_id}/content 下载 MP4。\n\n已通过 TKCreazy 公开网关端到端验证：multipart 图片/音频/视频上传、JSON 裸 Base64 图片、完整 Data URI 图片、上传素材完整读取和 Range 读取、纯文本生成、单图生成、首尾帧生成、多图生成、视频参考生成、图片+音频参考生成、任务列表、任务状态查询、结果完整下载和 Range 下载。实测生成组合为 seedance-2.0-fast、480p、5 秒、1:1。\n\n音频参考不是原音轨直通。若希望保留特定声音，prompt 必须明确写出保留什么声音、出现时段、音高/节奏/速度/强弱特征以及禁止替换成什么声音。实测明确要求全程保留 660Hz 持续电子提示音后，生成音频主频为 659.96Hz，580 至 740Hz 频段能量占比为 43.94%，音量包络相关性为 0.8362；但生成模型仍不保证完整保留或逐波形复制。要求原音频 100% 不变时，应在生成完成后自行合成或替换音轨。\n\nDELETE /videos/jobs/{job_id} 未列入本文档：公开网关实测时上游返回 HTTP 409 Video job cannot be canceled，因此不能作为当前可用能力对外承诺。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1",
      "description": "TKCreazy 公开网关"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Seedance v1 视频生成",
      "description": "TKCreazy 公开网关已完成端到端验证的 Seedance v1 上传、生成、查询与下载接口。"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/videos/uploads": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "上传图片、音频或视频参考文件",
        "description": "Apifox 使用 form-data 上传：\n1. 上传图片：字段名 image，类型 File，选择 PNG/JPEG。\n2. 上传音频：字段名 audio，类型 File，选择 WAV。\n3. 上传视频：字段名 video，类型 File，选择 MP4。\n4. image、audio、video 每次只能选择一个；需要多个素材时分别调用多次。\n5. 成功后复制完整 media_url。生成视频只使用 media_url，不要把 upload_id 填进生成请求。\n\n图片还支持 application/json：裸 Base64 填 image_base64，并同时填写 content_type；完整 Data URI 直接填 image_base64，不需要另写 content_type。Base64 只用于图片，不用于音频和视频。\n\nURL 对应关系：image_url/start_frame_url/end_frame_url 使用图片 media_url；guidances.image_reference[].image.url 使用图片 media_url；guidances.audio_reference[].audio.url 使用音频 media_url；guidances.video_reference_base[].video.url 使用视频 media_url。",
        "operationId": "uploadSeedanceMedia",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageUploadMultipartRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioUploadMultipartRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoUploadMultipartRequest"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "encoding": {
                "image": {
                  "contentType": "image/png, image/jpeg"
                },
                "audio": {
                  "contentType": "audio/wav"
                },
                "video": {
                  "contentType": "video/mp4"
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "uploadImage": {
                  "summary": "上传参考图片",
                  "description": "Apifox 中选择 form-data，字段名填 image，类型选择 File，选择 PNG/JPEG 图片。"
                },
                "uploadAudio": {
                  "summary": "上传参考音频",
                  "description": "Apifox 中选择 form-data，字段名填 audio，类型选择 File，选择 WAV 音频。"
                },
                "uploadVideo": {
                  "summary": "上传参考视频",
                  "description": "Apifox 中选择 form-data，字段名填 video，类型选择 File，选择 MP4 视频。"
                }
              }
            },
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageBase64UploadRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "bareBase64": {
                  "summary": "已测：裸 Base64 图片",
                  "value": {
                    "image_base64": "<BASE64_DATA>",
                    "content_type": "image/png",
                    "filename": "reference.png"
                  }
                },
                "dataUri": {
                  "summary": "已测：完整 Data URI 图片",
                  "value": {
                    "image_base64": "data:image/png;base64,<BASE64_DATA>",
                    "filename": "reference.png"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "上传成功。复制 media_url 到生成接口中使用。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceMediaUploadResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "image": {
                    "summary": "图片上传响应",
                    "value": {
                      "upload_id": "sdupl_example_image",
                      "media_url": "{{image_media_url}}",
                      "media_type": "image",
                      "content_type": "image/png",
                      "size": 72396,
                      "sha256": "d42c2780ffcedeb699ac245f42118b4ed082e61d1ba7146549b9df08607f2731",
                      "expires_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
                    }
                  },
                  "audio": {
                    "summary": "音频上传响应",
                    "value": {
                      "upload_id": "sdupl_example_audio",
                      "media_url": "{{audio_media_url}}",
                      "media_type": "audio",
                      "content_type": "audio/wav",
                      "size": 441044,
                      "sha256": "0f1e2d3c4b5a69788796a5b4c3d2e1f00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff",
                      "expires_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
                    }
                  },
                  "video": {
                    "summary": "视频上传响应",
                    "value": {
                      "upload_id": "sdupl_example_video",
                      "media_url": "{{video_media_url}}",
                      "media_type": "video",
                      "content_type": "video/mp4",
                      "size": 657828,
                      "sha256": "b7bd44535fd1c396dea7c09f754462fdfcea55e8ab3594f413261cded25ab498",
                      "expires_at": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/PayloadTooLarge"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/uploads/{upload_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "读取已上传的参考文件",
        "description": "使用上传接口返回的 upload_id 读取原始素材。这个接口用于预览、校验或断点读取上传文件；生成视频时仍应使用上传响应中的 media_url。已通过公开网关验证完整读取和 Range bytes=0-1023，返回文件 SHA-256 与上传源文件一致。",
        "operationId": "getSeedanceUploadedMedia",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/UploadID"
          },
          {
            "name": "Range",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "description": "可选范围读取，例如 bytes=0-1023。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "bytes=0-1023"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "完整素材文件。",
            "content": {
              "image/png": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "audio/wav": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              },
              "video/mp4": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "范围读取成功。",
            "headers": {
              "Content-Range": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "bytes 0-1023/72396"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/generations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "创建视频生成任务（纯文本、图片、视频和音频参考）",
        "description": "创建异步任务并返回 job_id。请先在 Apifox 的“请求示例”中选择正确模式，再替换提示词和 media_url 变量。\n\n纯文本：不上传文件，不填写 image_url、start_frame_url、end_frame_url 或 guidances。\n\n单图：先上传图片，把 media_url 填入 image_url；不要再填写其它图片字段。\n\n首尾帧：分别上传两张图片，填写 start_frame_url 和 end_frame_url；只使用尾帧不允许；不能与 image_url 或 image_reference 混用。\n\n多图参考：每张图片分别上传，填写 guidances.image_reference；order 从 0 开始；当前代码最多接受 4 张，本轮公开网关实测 2 张。\n\n视频参考：先用 video 字段上传 MP4，把 media_url 填入 guidances.video_reference_base[].video.url。\n\n图片+音频：图片和音频分别上传；audio=true；同时填写 image_reference 和 audio_reference。audio_reference 项不要写 order。\n\n音频提示词必须明确注入保留要求，例如：“请保留参考音频中的持续电子提示音，让它在视频全程出现，尽量保持相同音高、节奏和强弱，不要替换成环境音乐、对白或低频音效；允许为画面混音，但不要删除该电子提示音。”只写“参考音频”可能只生成相似风格声音，且明确约束后仍不保证逐波形复制。\n\n所有 URL 都必须使用上传接口刚返回的完整 media_url。创建接口不会直接返回视频文件；必须继续查询 job_id 并下载 content。已测生成组合：seedance-2.0-fast、480p、5 秒、1:1。",
        "operationId": "createSeedanceVideoJob",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceTextGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceSingleImageGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceStartEndFrameGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceMultiImageGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoReferenceGenerationRequest"
                  },
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageAudioGenerationRequest"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "textToVideo": {
                  "summary": "已测：纯文本生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "一只红色纸质购物袋放在明亮简洁的白色展示台上，镜头缓慢环绕并轻微推进，柔和商业灯光，画面干净，无字幕，无水印。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false
                  }
                },
                "singleImage": {
                  "summary": "已测：单图生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "以参考图片中的红色购物袋营销 logo 为主体，生成一个干净的商品展示短视频，镜头轻微推进，主体保持清晰可识别。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "image_url": "{{image_media_url}}"
                  }
                },
                "startEndFrames": {
                  "summary": "已测：首尾帧生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "从首帧中的红色购物袋品牌画面自然过渡到尾帧中的商品展示场景，镜头平稳连续移动，主体变化连贯，无字幕，无水印。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "start_frame_url": "{{image_media_url}}",
                    "end_frame_url": "{{image_media_url_2}}"
                  }
                },
                "multiImage": {
                  "summary": "已测：多图生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "参考两张图片生成一个商品展示视频：一个机器人拿着购物袋，购物袋上同时体现红色营销 logo 和蓝紫色品牌标识，画面干净明亮。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "guidances": {
                      "image_reference": [
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "{{image_media_url}}",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 0
                        },
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "{{image_media_url_2}}",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 1
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "videoReference": {
                  "summary": "已测：视频参考生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "参考上传视频的镜头移动节奏和商品展示方式，生成一个新的红色购物袋商业展示短片，镜头平稳连续，画面干净，无字幕，无水印。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": false,
                    "guidances": {
                      "video_reference_base": [
                        {
                          "video": {
                            "url": "{{video_media_url}}",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "imageWithAudio": {
                  "summary": "已测：图片 + 音频引用生成",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seedance-2.0-fast",
                    "prompt": "以参考图片中的红色购物袋营销 logo 为主体，生成一个 5 秒展示视频，镜头从近景缓慢后移，主体稳定可识别。请明确保留参考音频中的 660Hz 持续电子提示音，让该提示音从视频开始到结束全程出现，尽量保持相同音高、稳定节奏和强弱，不要替换成环境音乐、对白、低频音效或其他声音；允许为画面混音，但不要删除该电子提示音。",
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "480p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                    "audio": true,
                    "guidances": {
                      "image_reference": [
                        {
                          "image": {
                            "url": "{{image_media_url}}",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          },
                          "strength": "HIGH",
                          "order": 0
                        }
                      ],
                      "audio_reference": [
                        {
                          "audio": {
                            "url": "{{audio_media_url}}",
                            "type": "UPLOADED"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "任务已创建。继续查询任务状态。",
            "headers": {
              "Location": {
                "description": "任务状态查询地址。",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uri"
                }
              },
              "Preference-Applied": {
                "description": "异步任务响应标记。",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "respond-async"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJobCreateResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                  "status": "queued",
                  "status_url": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/jobs/vidjob_example_123"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/jobs": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "查询视频任务列表",
        "description": "返回当前 API Key 可见的 Seedance 任务。已通过公开网关验证 limit=5。任务列表可用于恢复客户端状态，但创建任务后仍建议保存 job_id。",
        "operationId": "listSeedanceVideoJobs",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "返回数量上限。本轮实测填写 5。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "example": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务列表。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJobListResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/jobs/{job_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "查询 Seedance 视频任务状态",
        "description": "使用创建任务返回的 job_id 查询状态。已通过网关测试 running 和 completed 状态。状态为 completed 后可下载 content。",
        "operationId": "getSeedanceVideoJob",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/JobID"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务状态。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJob"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "running": {
                    "summary": "运行中",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "status": "running"
                    }
                  },
                  "completed": {
                    "summary": "已完成",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "job_id": "vidjob_example_123",
                      "status": "completed"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/videos/jobs/{job_id}/content": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Seedance v1 视频生成"
        ],
        "summary": "下载 Seedance 视频结果 MP4",
        "description": "任务 completed 后调用。已通过网关测试返回 video/mp4，并能下载单图、多图、图片+音频三类生成结果。音频引用任务下载的 MP4 包含视频轨和音频轨；单图/多图示例因为 audio=false，仅包含视频轨。",
        "operationId": "downloadSeedanceVideoJobContent",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/JobID"
          },
          {
            "name": "Range",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "description": "可选范围下载，例如 bytes=0-1023。客户端应以实际 HTTP 状态码和 Content-Range 为准。",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "bytes=0-1023"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "完整 MP4 文件。",
            "content": {
              "video/mp4": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "206": {
            "description": "范围下载 MP4 片段。",
            "headers": {
              "Content-Range": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "example": "bytes 0-1023/740415"
                }
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "video/mp4": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServiceUnavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "填写本站 API Key：Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_API_KEY>"
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "UploadID": {
        "name": "upload_id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "上传接口返回的 upload_id，仅用于读取已上传文件。",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "sdupl_example_image"
        }
      },
      "JobID": {
        "name": "job_id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "description": "创建任务返回的 job_id。",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "vidjob_example_123"
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SeedanceImageUploadMultipartRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "binary",
            "description": "参考图片文件。已测 image/png 和 image/jpeg。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceAudioUploadMultipartRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audio": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "binary",
            "description": "参考音频文件。已测 audio/wav。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceVideoUploadMultipartRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "video"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "video": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "binary",
            "description": "参考视频文件。已通过公开网关实测 video/mp4。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceImageBase64UploadRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image_base64"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image_base64": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "裸 Base64 或完整 data:image/...;base64,...。裸 Base64 必须同时填写 content_type。"
          },
          "content_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "裸 Base64 必填，例如 image/png；完整 Data URI 可以省略。",
            "example": "image/png"
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "可选文件名。",
            "example": "reference.png"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceMediaUploadResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "upload_id",
          "media_url",
          "media_type",
          "content_type",
          "size",
          "sha256",
          "expires_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "upload_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "上传记录 ID，仅用于标识。生成接口请使用 media_url。",
            "example": "sdupl_example_image"
          },
          "media_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "可在生成接口中引用的素材 URL。复制响应中的完整实际值，不要改写、截断或使用 upload_id 代替。",
            "example": "{{image_media_url}}"
          },
          "media_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image",
              "audio",
              "video"
            ],
            "description": "公开网关已实测的素材类型。"
          },
          "content_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "image/png"
          },
          "size": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64",
            "example": 72396
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "d42c2780ffcedeb699ac245f42118b4ed082e61d1ba7146549b9df08607f2731"
          },
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-08-03T12:00:00Z"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedanceBaseGenerationFields": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "prompt",
          "duration",
          "resolution",
          "aspect_ratio",
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "seedance-2.0-fast"
            ],
            "description": "当前最终示例全部通过该模型完成。其它模型名是否可用取决于 API Key 所属分组配置。"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "视频提示词。使用 audio_reference 时必须明确写出需要保留的具体声音、出现时段、音高/节奏/速度/强弱特征以及禁止替换成的声音。只写“参考音频”或“跟随节奏”可能只生成相同风格音频，不保证保留原声音。即使明确约束，也不保证完整保留或逐波形复制。"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 4,
            "maximum": 15,
            "default": 8,
            "example": 5,
            "description": "网关接受 4 至 15 秒；省略或填 0 时按 8 秒归一化。最终示例实测 5 秒。"
          },
          "resolution": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "480p",
              "720p",
              "1080p"
            ],
            "example": "480p",
            "description": "网关参数范围。具体模型、价格和账号是否允许该分辨率取决于当前分组配置；最终示例实测 480p。"
          },
          "aspect_ratio": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "adaptive",
              "16:9",
              "9:16",
              "1:1",
              "4:3",
              "3:4",
              "21:9",
              "9:21"
            ],
            "example": "1:1",
            "description": "网关接受的画幅比例；最终示例实测 1:1。"
          },
          "audio": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否生成音频轨。图片+音频引用必须填 true，并同时提供 guidances.audio_reference；只填 true 不代表使用了参考音频。单图、多图无音频示例填 false。"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedanceTextGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "纯文本生成不要填写任何素材字段。",
            "not": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "required": [
                    "image_url"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "start_frame_url"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "end_frame_url"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "required": [
                    "guidances"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceSingleImageGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "image_url"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "image_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri",
                "description": "图片上传返回的完整 media_url。"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceStartEndFrameGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "start_frame_url",
              "end_frame_url"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "start_frame_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri",
                "description": "首帧图片上传返回的完整 media_url。"
              },
              "end_frame_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri",
                "description": "尾帧图片上传返回的完整 media_url。不能单独使用尾帧。"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceMultiImageGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "guidances"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "guidances": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "image_reference"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "image_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 2,
                    "maxItems": 4,
                    "description": "网关最多接受 4 张参考图片；公开网关 E2E 实测 2 张。",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageReference"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceVideoReferenceGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "guidances"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  false
                ]
              },
              "guidances": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "video_reference_base"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "video_reference_base": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 1,
                    "description": "公开网关已实测 1 个 MP4 视频参考。",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoReference"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceImageAudioGenerationRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceBaseGenerationFields"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "guidances"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "audio": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "enum": [
                  true
                ]
              },
              "guidances": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "image_reference",
                  "audio_reference"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "image_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 1,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageReference"
                    }
                  },
                  "audio_reference": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 1,
                    "description": "只放 1 个音频引用。audio_reference 项不要填写 order 字段；音频 url 使用上传音频返回的完整 media_url。audio_reference 是生成参考，不是原音轨直通；prompt 还必须明确写出要保留的具体声音和音频特征。",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioReference"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "SeedanceImageReference": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "image"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "image": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceImageMediaRef"
          },
          "strength": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "LOW",
              "MID",
              "HIGH"
            ],
            "description": "网关接受 LOW、MID、HIGH；未填写或填写其它值时归一化为 MID。最终示例实测 HIGH。"
          },
          "order": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "图片顺序。本轮多图实测使用 0 和 1。"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceVideoReference": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "video"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "video": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoMediaRef"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceAudioReference": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audio": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceAudioMediaRef"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceImageMediaRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "图片上传接口返回的完整 media_url。不要填 upload_id，不要使用文档示例值。"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "UPLOADED"
            ]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceAudioMediaRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "音频上传接口返回的完整 media_url。不要填 upload_id，不要截断签名参数，不要给音频引用增加 order。"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "UPLOADED"
            ]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceVideoMediaRef": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "视频上传接口返回的完整 media_url。不要填 upload_id。"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "UPLOADED"
            ]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "SeedanceVideoJobCreateResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "job_id",
          "status",
          "status_url"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "job_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "vidjob_example_123"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "queued"
          },
          "status_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://tkcreazy.top/v1/videos/jobs/vidjob_example_123"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedanceVideoJob": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "vidjob_example_123"
          },
          "job_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "vidjob_example_123"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "queued",
              "pending",
              "running",
              "completed",
              "failed",
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "description": "继续轮询 queued、pending、running；completed 后下载；failed 时读取 error。"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "seedance-2.0-fast"
          },
          "prompt": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "completed_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "result": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "完成任务的结果元数据，其中视频 URL 会指向本站 /content 地址。",
            "additionalProperties": true
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "SeedanceVideoJobListResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedanceVideoJob"
            }
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 400
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "invalid request"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "invalid_request"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "请求参数错误。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "未提供或未通过 API Key 鉴权。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Forbidden": {
        "description": "当前 API Key 无权调用该分组或该模型。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "任务或素材不存在、过期，或不属于当前 API Key。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "PayloadTooLarge": {
        "description": "上传文件过大。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ServiceUnavailable": {
        "description": "服务暂时不可用、分组配置不足或当前无可用账号。",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
